msgstr "HOMEPAGE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:402
msgid ""
"More information about live-config and the Debian Live project can be found "
"on the homepage at E<lt>I<https://wiki.debian.org/DebianLive>E<gt> and in "
